# Prerendered pages are real files and are served directly.
# Everything else (admin, /join/CODE, /room/CODE, unknown URLs) is rewritten to
# the built index.html so the SPA can boot and route on the client.
# NEVER point this rule at a non-index .html file such as /200.html: Pages
# normalises that target to /200 and turns the rule into a real 308, which then
# re-matches /* and loops forever. That took the whole site down on 2026-11-25.
/*    /index.html   200
